d anything else you can find to keep yourself alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when the road becomes too arduous to walk alone—call your posse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734220/extras/849267d3196e969143e828b8a96dfbca.poster.avif?t=1787771126\" width=1170 height=682 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734220/extras/849267d3196e969143e828b8a96dfbca.webm?t=1787771126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734220/extras/849267d3196e969143e828b8a96dfbca.mp4?t=1787771126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734220/extras/9b836f48bff5d5604c8b077a9f2b3b39.avif?t=1787771126\" width=880 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a personal journey through a world-scale catastrophe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a man who has lost almost everything, trying to return home before the last scraps are taken from him. The road ahead runs across the Old South of America - now transformed into a haunted frontier of ruined settlements, mythic roads, impossible machines, monstrous factions, and historical figures caught between legend and damnation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not only the end of America.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is the beginning of something far worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734220/extras/ee00e45ccb40d41d0e6d5c32c9e79dbb.poster.avi