 Burning”. Across ruined settlements and forgotten frontiers, reality bends beneath ancient forces, competing faiths, and impossible myths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Codex: Use a hand-drawn Cherokee Codex to study enemy behavior, weak points, anatomy, rituals, and hidden rules. Lore is not just decoration; lore is your weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734220/extras/3a4969cd1649265fb9ab25965be07d12.poster.avif?t=1787771126\" width=1170 height=682 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734220/extras/3a4969cd1649265fb9ab25965be07d12.webm?t=1787771126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734220/extras/3a4969cd1649265fb9ab25965be07d12.mp4?t=1787771126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734220/extras/ed9c48a37001ba38065206e37e535c02.avif?t=1787771126\" width=880 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inevitably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will rise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inevitably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Black Rider will still be ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world will still be burning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The revolver will still be in your hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is only one way to end it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734220/extras/1ccbd3e99556694ea447a1fe122bd